{"title":"Gradient","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The gradient of a function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84e54f95933186f54643a5cdfcf3ba5bbeb15cbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x,y,z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" /> is the vector\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/b/73b1e3ff0fce4017b14bef381d1312051f5c317b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\nabla f(x,y,z) =   \\begin{bmatrix}            \\dfrac{\\partial f(x,y,z)}{\\partial x} \\\\            \\dfrac{\\partial f(x,y,z)}{\\partial y} \\\\            \\dfrac{\\partial f(x,y,z)}{\\partial z} \\\\           \\end{bmatrix}\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"119\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018085814\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.002 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.003 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 545/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:28724:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018085814 and revision id 225995. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}